    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c++" data-lang="c++"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">class</span> <span class="nc">Solution</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
